s8-3-p34 = prose (cons "A change from one byte layout to another can transport the state representation and the dependent proof if a suitable equivalence of *structured machine states* has been established. The actual source expression, its typed syntax, its interpretation, and the proof remain separately identifiable constructions. Nothing requires a privileged sequence in which the proof is “attached,” then “lowered,” then “realized.” We may work on any of these objects and their relationships." nil)
